('APX-C-4297', '4297', 'Packed Stadium Roaring under Floodlights', 'A packed stadium roaring under floodlights, the pitch a vivid emerald green slicked with evening dew, white yard lines glowing under the intense overhead lights. The scoreboard reads 89th minute — one goal down. Tension crackling through every seat in the house.', 15, null, 'https://x.com/DoctorAmna11/status/2052039042254966851', 'A packed stadium roaring under floodlights, the pitch a vivid emerald green slicked with evening dew, white yard lines glowing under the intense overhead lights. The scoreboard reads 89th minute — one goal down. Tension crackling through every seat in the house. A female footballer receives the ball just inside the opposition half — number 10 on her back, boots worn and mud-streaked, jaw set with absolute iron determination. First defender charges in — she rolls the ball through his legs with surgical precision — nutmeg — the crowd gasps. She explodes forward, low and fast, hair flying behind her. Second defender closes aggressively from the right — she barely glances up — slides the ball calmly through his legs without breaking stride — second nutmeg — the stadium erupts louder. She enters the box at full sprint, third defender lunges desperately — she drags the ball back one touch then pings it clean through the final gap — third nutmeg — the goalkeeper comes off her line — the striker takes one composing breath in real time slow motion — drives the ball low and hard into the bottom left corner. The net ripples violently. A split second of complete silence. Then the entire stadium detonates — seventy thousand people exploding to their feet simultaneously. The girl wheels away screaming at the top of her lungs, face contorted with pure raw emotion, sprinting full speed toward the corner flag, fists clenched, tears streaming down her face. She reaches the flag and screams into the night sky — teammates pile onto her from every direction — an avalanche of bodies and joy. Ca