('APX-C-4214', '4214', 'Time-lapse of a Cracked Desert Transforming into a Lush', 'Cinematic time-lapse of a cracked desert transforming into a lush green oasis. A thin stream of water flows through dry, broken earth, then rapidly expands, triggering fertile soil to spread and vegetation to sprout.', null, null, 'https://x.com/arghzq/status/2051645729345573228', 'Ultra-realistic cinematic time-lapse of a cracked desert transforming into a lush green oasis. A thin stream of water flows through dry, broken earth, then rapidly expands, triggering fertile soil to spread and vegetation to sprout. Plants grow instantly into fruit-filled trees - apples, oranges, cucumbers, tomatoes, and melons - turning the desert into a dense garden. Yellow birds appear, flying and perching as life flourishes. Smooth camera push-in, natural daylight shifting from harsh desert tones to vibrant greenery. Hyper-detailed, 4K, cinematic nature transformation, continuous motion, final frame shows a fully thriving orchard with flowing water and wildlife.', null, null, 'missing', 3, 'keep', 'pass', 'aspirational', 'photoreal', null, '24fps-cinematic', 'none', null, 'offline real-world gate: real-world: photoreal', 'seedance_2.0', '@arghzq', 'https://x.com/arghzq', null, null)
