('APX-S-4310-1', 'APX-C-4310', 1, null, null, null, 'Dark cinematic thriller, 9:16 vertical, low light, realistic panic emotions, handheld camera, suspense atmosphere. A man sits with his eyes closed, breathing heavily in panic. His hands search desperately for a glass of water on the table.', null, null, 'A man sits with his eyes closed, breathing heavily in panic. His hands search desperately for a glass of water on the table.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4310-2', 'APX-C-4310', 2, null, null, null, 'A mysterious girl beside him slowly pulls the glass away before he can touch it. He freezes in fear. The girl finally hands him the glass with a cold emotionless smile. Extreme close-up on the man’s terrified eyes. Dark ambient music, cinematic tension, realistic shadows, film grain.', null, null, 'A mysterious girl beside him slowly pulls the glass away before he can touch it. The girl finally hands him the glass with a cold emotionless smile. Extreme close-up on the man’s terrified eyes.', null, null, null, null, null, 'intense'),
('APX-S-4284-1', 'APX-C-4284', 1, null, null, null, 'Ultra-realistic Gen Z TikTok aesthetic, raw iPhone footage, cozy-girl energy, “camera roll dump” vibe, accidental beauty, dreamy but relatable. Feels like a viral Reel from someone’s private morning routine — intimate, imperfect, addictive to watch. ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 📸 STORYBOARD 1 — “5:02 AM”Extreme close-up of a girl buried in fluffy blankets. Messy hair everywhere, sleepy face half-hidden in pillow. One eye opens slowly while sunlight leaks across her face. Camera slightly shaky like a spontaneous clip filmed by a best friend.', null, null, '━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 📸 STORYBOARD 1 — “AM”Extreme close-up of a girl buried in fluffy blankets. One eye opens slowly while sunlight leaks across her face.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4284-2', 'APX-C-4284', 2, null, null, null, 'Tiny skin details visible, no makeup, soft breathing audio. On-screen text:“woke up too pretty for no reason ✨” Mood: sleepy Gen Z softness. ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 📸 STORYBOARD 2 — “Phone First”POV handheld shot from bed angle. She reaches blindly for her phone while still half asleep. The camera accidentally tilts sideways. Oversized night dress falling naturally from shoulder. Phone brightness hits her face in dark-soft contrast. Tiny laugh under breath. Mood: relatable “first thing I do” energy. ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 📸 STORYBOARD 3 — “Main Character Morning”Medium shot.', null, null, 'She reaches blindly for her phone while still half asleep. The camera accidentally tilts sideways. Phone brightness hits her face in dark-soft contrast.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4284-3', 'APX-C-4284', 3, null, null, null, 'She sits up slowly, pushing messy hair back while sunlight glows through loose strands. Curtains moving softly. Background slightly messy with hoodie on chair, lip balm on bed, water bottle nearby for realistic Gen Z room aesthetic. Slow zoom-in like a candid TikTok clip. Mood: soft-life main character energy. ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 📸 STORYBOARD 4 — “Mirror Check”Blurry mirror clip with imperfect framing. She stares at herself for a second while adjusting her hair naturally. Slight lens smudge effect like real iPhone camera.', null, null, 'She sits up slowly, pushing messy hair back while sunlight glows through loose strands. She stares at herself for a second while adjusting her hair naturally.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4284-4', 'APX-C-4284', 4, null, null, null, 'Soft film grain. Calm silence. On-screen text:“trying to wake up mentally…” Mood: effortlessly aesthetic. ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 📸 STORYBOARD 5 — “Morning Air”Side-profile near open window. Wind moves her messy hair gently while she closes her eyes for a second. Warm sunlight wraps around her silhouette. Camera focus shifts naturally like accidental cinematic footage. Background sound:birds + distant traffic + blanket movement. Mood: peaceful Pinterest morning. ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 📸 STORYBOARD 6 — “Soft Exit”Wide shot.', null, null, 'Wind moves her messy hair gently while she closes her eyes for a second. Warm sunlight wraps around her silhouette.', null, null, null, null, null, 'calm'),
('APX-S-4284-5', 'APX-C-4284', 5, null, null, null, 'She walks out toward the kitchen while camera stays focused on messy bed and morning sunlight. Slight overexposed lens flare hits camera naturally. Scene ends before she fully exits frame — like unfinished real-life footage. Ending vibe:“this feels like a memory instead of a video.” ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 🎨 VISUAL STYLE• iPhone 15 Pro front-camera realism• TikTok soft-life aesthetic• Natural skin texture + eye bags• Slight overexposure from sunlight• Film grain + focus breathing• Cozy messy bedroom realism• Slow handheld movements• No perfect posing• Feels accidental, not directed 🎵 AUDIO STYLELow-volume dreamy indie audio + soft room ambience + blanket sounds + distant birds.', null, null, 'She walks out toward the kitchen while camera stays focused on messy bed and morning sunlight. Scene ends before she fully exits frame — like unfinished real-life footage.', null, null, null, null, 'kitchen, bedroom', null),
