('APX-S-4319-1', 'APX-C-4319', 1, null, null, null, 'Hyper-realistic cinematic video, vertical [9:16], DSLR-quality realism. Opening shot: Extreme macro close-up of a tiny medicine-style capsule (pill-sized, approx. 3–4 cm) held delicately between a human thumb and index finger. The capsule looks exactly like a real pharmaceutical pill — smooth, rounded ends. One half of the capsule is transparent glass, the other half glossy Ferrari-red plastic.', null, null, 'Opening shot: Extreme macro close-up of a tiny medicine-style capsule (pill-sized, approx. 3–4 cm) held delicately between a human thumb and index finger. The capsule looks exactly like a real pharmaceutical pill — smooth, rounded ends.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4319-2', 'APX-C-4319', 2, null, null, null, 'On the plastic half, a clear Ferrari logo (Prancing Horse) and the Ferrari name are printed sharply with premium reflections. Inside the glass half, a photorealistic miniature red Ferrari sports car 3D model floats perfectly centered, suspended in zero gravity. The Ferrari logo is clearly visible on the miniature car (front badge and wheel center caps), ultra-detailed.', null, null, 'On the plastic half, a clear Ferrari logo (Prancing Horse) and the Ferrari name are printed sharply with premium reflections.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4319-3', 'APX-C-4319', 3, null, null, null, 'Camera performs a slow cinematic macro zoom-in. Below is a freshly dug planting hole with dry, loose soil, surrounded by short green grass, like soil prepared for planting a seed. No water, no mud. Action: The hand lowers the capsule into the hole. The capsule is fully buried and completely disappears under the soil. Fingers gently cover it with loose earth, soil settling naturally.', null, null, 'The hand lowers the capsule into the hole.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4319-4', 'APX-C-4319', 4, null, null, null, 'Brief pause: The soil surface remains still for a moment. Transformation: The ground bulges and cracks from underneath, soil lifting and breaking apart. A large form pushes upward. Reveal: A FULL-SIZE, REAL-WORLD Ferrari sports car (1:1 scale) emerges from the ground — actual real-life car size, not miniature, not scaled. The Ferrari logo is clearly visible on the front badge, wheels, and rear, perfectly matching the miniature seen inside the capsule.', null, null, 'Brief pause: The soil surface remains still for a moment. Transformation: The ground bulges and cracks from underneath, soil lifting and breaking apart. A large form pushes upward.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4319-5', 'APX-C-4319', 5, null, null, null, 'Final frame: The life-sized Ferrari stands firmly on solid ground, dry soil around the tires, grass bent naturally. Paint reflections are sharp and realistic, luxury automotive finish. Background remains softly blurred, elegant, light-toned, professional studio lighting, cinematic depth of field. Style: ultra-realistic, premium luxury automotive reveal Camera: macro → wide cinematic transition No text, no UI, no glow, no cartoon look.', null, null, 'Final frame: The life-sized Ferrari stands firmly on solid ground, dry soil around the tires, grass bent naturally. Paint reflections are sharp and, luxury automotive finish.', null, null, null, null, 'studio', null),
('APX-S-4286-1', 'APX-C-4286', 1, null, null, null, 'Cinematic Hook (Mood, Style, Camera Framing): Dreamlike tone, surreal aesthetic, wide shot with shallow depth of field. Visual Elements: A lone, androgynous figure in flowing, translucent white robes walks barefoot across a dune ridge — the fabric trailing like vapor in the wind. Their skin glows with an unnatural luminance, and they leave no footprints behind.', null, null, 'Their skin glows with an unnatural luminance, and they leave no footprints behind.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4286-2', 'APX-C-4286', 2, null, null, null, 'The desert is vast and empty, with undulating sand dunes stretching to the horizon, interrupted only by a solitary, gnarled tree with golden leaves that shimmer unnaturally. Atmosphere and Sensory Detail: Lighting: Hard, high-angle lighting casts exaggerated, sharp shadows; sunlight refracts through heat haze, causing mirage-like ripples.', null, null, 'The desert is vast and empty, with undulating sand dunes stretching to the horizon, interrupted only by a solitary, gnarled tree with golden leaves that shimmer unnaturally.', null, null, null, null, 'desert', null),
('APX-S-4286-3', 'APX-C-4286', 3, null, null, null, 'Color Palette: Pale gold, bone white, rose quartz, muted sapphire, soft peach. Atmospheric Conditions: Still air with subtle drifting sand; faint lens flare as the sun flares against the sky. Textures: Fine-grained sand glistening like powdered glass, the bark of the tree cracked and iridescent.', null, null, 'Pale gold, bone white, rose quartz, muted sapphire, soft peach. Atmospheric Conditions: Still air with subtle drifting sand; faint as the sun flares against the sky.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4286-4', 'APX-C-4286', 4, null, null, null, 'Implicit Sounds: Whispers carried on a silent wind, the faint crackle of heat distortion. Choreographed Movement and Camera Dynamics: Subject Movement: The figure moves slowly and deliberately, arms slightly raised, fingers grazing the air as if tracing unseen currents. Camera Movement: Slow dolly forward with a slight vertical rise, emulating a floating dreamlike perspective; slight parallax effect as dunes drift laterally in the foreground.', null, null, 'Implicit Sounds: Whispers carried on a silent wind, the faint crackle of heat distortion. Choreographed Movement and Camera Dynamics: Subject Movement: The figure moves slowly and deliberately, arms slightly raised, fingers grazing the air…', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4286-5', 'APX-C-4286', 5, null, null, null, 'Compositional Language: The subject is framed on the lower third line, the horizon bisects the top third; the gnarled tree is placed on the right using the rule of thirds. The use of shallow depth of field isolates the figure from the receding dunes, enhancing the surreal isolation.', null, null, 'Compositional Language: The subject is framed on the lower third line, the horizon bisects the top third; the gnarled tree is placed on the right using the rule of thirds.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
